cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LDS Reference Profiles (LRP) corpus"
message: >-
  If you use this corpus or its schema, please cite it using the metadata below.
  A Zenodo DOI will be added when a stable release is deposited.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Kazuru
    given-names: Seke
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-4099-1059"
    email: kazuruuni@gmail.com
    affiliation: Independent Researcher
repository-code: "https://github.com/kazuru-chidumbwe/lrp-corpus"
url: "https://github.com/kazuru-chidumbwe/lrp-corpus"
abstract: >-
  Open, fault-injected corpus of synthetic eMRTD Logical Data Structure artefacts
  tagged by layer (writer, chip, reader-implicating). Each profile bundles on-chip
  EF bytes with a machine-readable manifest for Passive Authentication and
  laboratory conformance testing. All material is synthetic; no live country keys
  or operational documents.
keywords:
  - eMRTD
  - ICAO 9303
  - ISO 39794
  - passive-authentication
  - conformance-testing
  - reference-corpus
  - LDS
  - fault-injection
license:
